WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.850
Looks like this is the place.

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.400
A likely spot for a legendary item, all right.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:12.490
Sheesh. Why do <i>we</i>
have to go fetch it, anyway?

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.280
The Pope has been
on the lookout for a replacement

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.990
ever since the Big Five broke one the other day.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:22.290
It's not like we have a choice:
we need it to beat the Big Bad.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.790
Will you open it already, octowuss?

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:30.800
W-W-W-Wait! Boss-level monsters
pop out of these things!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.840
Tread carefully!

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.220
--Why's the Big Bad the most afraid?
--Carefully!

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.340
--Professor Bitch even came along.
--<i>Carefully</i>!

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.800
Of course I did!

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.220
I hear the legendary
Too-Dangerous Swimsuit is hidden here, too!

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:45.690
I can charm anyone with that--
even that stick-in-the-mud Karasuma!

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.560
As if.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.690
The Too-Dangerous Swimsuit?

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.110
Would you mind terribly telling us more?

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:54.400
May we begin preparations for you to try it on?

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.700
No, you may not!

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.700
She won't wear it here, of all places!

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.410
I think the Mosquito-Bite Squad
can stay out of this.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.160
Who are you calling the Mosquito-Bite Squad?!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Nagisa, open the chest already.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.170
Uh, okay. Well, here goes...

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:10.460
Wonder what's going to come out?

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:13.840
What the--

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.260
Eh?

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.560
Huh? It's empty!

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:26.940
Huh! So it was just for show.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:27.600
--Eh?
--Huh?

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.610
What the heck is going on?!

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:31.110
What <i>is</i> this? <i>How</i> is this?

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:32.150
Could it be...

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.570
Are we...

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.070
Itona?!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.110
I'm over here.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:39.280
--What?!
--What's going on? What am I--

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:55.420
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:04.850
"Nagisa"

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:06.520
"Karma"

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:07.520
"Kaede"

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:08.850
"Isogai" "Maehara"

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:11.520
"Rio" "Okuda" "Sugino" "Kanzaki"

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.020
"Itona" "Ritsu"

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:14.530
"Chiba" "Hayami" "Hinata" "Meg"

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.030
"Hinano" "Takebayashi" "Toka" "Justice"

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.030
"Muramatsu" "Kirara" "Yoshida" "Terasaka"

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.030
"Okajima" "Hara" "Mimura" "Fuwa" "Sugaya"

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.030
"Karasuma" "Irina"

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.260
"Big Bad Switcheroo"

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.840
What's going on?

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:45.180
"Meg" "Kaede" "Yada"

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.470
I've turned into Kaede!

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.060
--This sucks, sucks, sucks, <i>sucks</i>...!
--And I'm Yada! But how?

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.060
Huh!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:50.770
"Karma" "Nagisa"

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.770
Seems we've all swapped bodies and minds.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.560
Whoa! I totally <i>am</i> Isogai!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:03:02.360
"Maehara" "Isogai"

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.150
And I'm Maehara...

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:58.490
Feels kinda weird
being in someone else's body.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:02:59.900
Kinda... breezy.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.360
That's because <i>you're</i> breezy!

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.620
Sir, what does this mean?

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.830
"Yada"

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:10.210
Hmm. It seems bugs reside
not in the body, but in the mind.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.960
So the bodies may be switched,
but the bugs stay behind.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:16.050
Don't move my body in funnier ways than I do!

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:20.340
And even if Isogai's bug goes away,
his equipment stays the same,

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:26.060
"Maehara" "Isogai" "Yada" "Kaede"

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.840
so this is how you two wind up.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.680
Seriously?

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.020
Let me go!

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.100
Kataoka?!

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.270
"Nagisa"

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.060
Set me free!

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:34.520
"Okajima"

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.730
Let me have this dream! Let me have it!

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.860
"Okajima" "Itona"
"Nagisa" "Maehara" "Koro Sensei" "Meg"

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:35.980
Don't look, Isogai!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.360
"Okajima" "Itona"
"Nagisa" "Maehara" "Koro Sensei" "Meg"
"Isogai"

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.270
Oh, I'm over here.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.230
This is too confusing!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.360
So Kataoka is Okajima?

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:45.280
"Karma" "Yada"

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.910
Poor Meg. I'm glad I'm Kaede!

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.950
Right, Kaede?

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:49.330
So <i>this</i> is the difference
between the haves and the have-nots!

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.750
I'll live my whole life as you, Yada!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.750
Kaede?!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.080
"Maehara"

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.290
Hey, whatever happened to Professor Bitch?

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.170
Commander Karasuma's not around, either.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:00.760
No! What's with this knockout?
She'll charm me, all right!

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.800
Irina, stop! Don't take my clothes off!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.430
<i>Or</i> yours!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:12.140
I'll just make this a done deal
and you'll be mine!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.850
Quit doing that with my face!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.230
Isogai, <i>you</i> stop making that face, too!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:18.020
Kataoka sure has her hands full.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.400
Poor Meg!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.820
There's something up ahead.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.780
Let's keep going.
We might find a way to undo this.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.700
Huh? You two didn't swap?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.540
--No, we swapped.
--No, we swapped.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:30.580
I'm Chiba...

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.540
...and that's Hayami.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.620
How adaptable can you get?!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.080
Koro-Q.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:35.620
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.580
"Irina" "Okajima"

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.760
We stayed behind to stand guard...

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:43.670
"Kaede" "Yada" "Meg"

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.880
...but are Rinka and the others really okay?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:52.350
"Maehara" "Isogai" "Nagisa"

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.590
Can Karma even fight well
with that body of mine?

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:51.020
Well, they <i>do</i> have Koro Sensei
and Commander Karasuma.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.600
They'll be fine.

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:58.810
How foolish you are to have come this far in!

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.480
"Some Caterpillar Kunudon appeared!"

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:03.740
"Koro Sensei"

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.780
I may look different, but I'm just as fast.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.570
With my powers, this'll be over in no time!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.740
Koro Sensei!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:14.040
I moved like I always do
with my tentacles and tripped!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.660
A textbook face-fault...

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:16.920
Let me see that again!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.250
Quit goofing around!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:22.170
Okay, teach, we'll leave this
to you and move on.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.590
You fight, too!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.880
--Must be rough without your comedy partner.
--The two of you teachers ought to be enough!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:28.680
"Hayami" "Chiba"

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.300
--We're just not that kind of people.
--Don't start with me!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:33.140
If we don't fix this soon,
who knows <i>what</i> Okajima'll do.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:33.430
"Karma"

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.650
Well, <i>that</i> was a dud.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.440
What the--

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.360
Hey, are you sure about this?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:50.450
If there's a monster attack, we'll be done for!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.030
No need to worry!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:59.420
"Maehara" "Isogai"

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:56.000
Maehara and I have similar builds
and can fight just fine.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.210
--Yep!
--If push comes to shove,
I'll keep everyone safe.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.960
Even swapped and with
his butt showing--what a man!

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.510
Say... Okajima's being a little too quiet.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:07.380
"Yada"

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:08.220
Are you sure he's okay up there?

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.850
You think his rope's tied too tight?

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:14.220
Maybe we should loosen it a tad.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.600
Mmm... yeah, probably.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:20.810
I mean, he hasn't tried anything yet...
It's kind of pitiful.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:25.400
"Maehara" "Isogai" "Okajima" "Meg" "Kaede"

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.740
"Bound and abandoned" roleplay...

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.910
Just thinking about my sitch
here gets me <i>all</i> heated up!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.780
Eeek!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.910
"Meg"

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.790
Stop! Don't look!

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.580
"Meg" "Isogai"

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.660
"Meg" "Isogai"
"Maehara"

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:35.870
<i>You</i> stop!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.540
My eyes! My eyes!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.830
What was that?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:49.720
"Nagisa" "Kaede"

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.580
What's wrong, Nagisa?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.090
I feel like... something's not right.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.840
Like something happened to my body...

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.720
Just this weird foreboding.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.680
"Meg" "Isogai"

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.850
You mean, like something happened to Karma?

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.850
I'm gonna go check it out. You guys stay here!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.390
Hey! Nagisa!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:58.890
"Meg" "Maehara"

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.480
We're coming, too!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.600
What's all this?

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.480
There's a hidden room over here!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.360
"Hayami" "Chiba"

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.360
Chiba! Hayami!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.280
Nagisa?

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.110
Where's Karma?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.490
Huh?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.660
No... it can't be!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.910
Was Karma... done in?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.740
"Okajima"

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.330
"Karasuma"

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.530
Karma!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.540
Nagisa! Avert your eyes!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.500
Avert my eyes?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.250
"Nagisa"

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.370
What are you <i>doing</i>?!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.090
I found the Too-Dangerous Swimsuit!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.840
And why are you <i>wearing</i> it?!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:29.670
"Karasuma" "Nagisa"

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.670
Sorry, Nagisa. I tried to stop him.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.470
It's girls-only armor,
but <i>you</i> can still equip it!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.180
That's Nagisa for you!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:36.560
You're a funny one, aren't you.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.640
I'm not <i>happy</i> about this!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.190
"Isogai" "Yada"

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.890
We found a chest further in!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.810
Ooh! That's a Swap Orb!

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:48.030
If we use that, we're sure to switch back!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.400
Then let's get to it!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.750
Huh? Where am I?

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.950
--We're back!
--We're back!

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.540
I'm <i>back</i>!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.710
Switched back, safe and sound!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:08.460
--I'm back! Back! Oh, thank heavens: I'm <i>back</i>!
--It's over, and I didn't get to do a thing.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.090
--Can I tell you how <i>great</i> it is
to be back in my own body?!
--I'm back to being one of the have-nots...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.220
--Can I tell you how <i>great</i> it is
to be back in my own body?!
--Okajima, Kaede...

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.470
Now that we've switched back,
let's high-tail it out of here!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.260
Yeah! Come on, Koro Sensei!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.480
Koro Sensei? What's wrong?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.900
--Don't tell me...
--Is he still Itona?

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.230
I'm back to normal.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.940
Huh? Then why isn't
Koro Sensei saying anything?

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:34.030
Hey! Koro Sensei!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.870
What the heck?!
How'd I wind up as the Big Bad?

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:40.330
Damnation!
What kind of crazy scheme <i>is</i> this?!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:41.910
What just happened?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.160
Huh?! It can't be!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:53.760
Wait up! Give me my body back!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:09:00.100
So... I guess I'm stuck here.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:10:00.570
"Next Time: Showdown at Fuma Tower!"
